#3201
gatekeeper ashen~
the Ashen Gatekeeper~
The Ashen Gatekeeper stands under the burnt arch of the gate.
~
    Tall as two men in a harness of ash-grey plate, the Gatekeeper has
held the Spire's gate since the Spire had a gate.  The visor is a
narrow slot, the gauntlets are the size of a man's head, and the
great sword it rests on has never once been drawn inside the walls.
No one who has made it draw that sword outside the walls has
described the result.
~
