prelate grey~
the Grey Prelate~
The Grey Prelate of the Spire rises from the twelfth chair.
~
    The Council's chair is a formality and the Prelate is not.  He is
old in a way that the Spire's ash does not touch, dressed in grey
vestments stitched with tin wire, and he speaks for the tower to the
world and for the world to the tower.  He has kept the Spire fed,
supplied and secret for three lifetimes, and he intends to keep it.
~
